source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A digit is a word rune, so it refuses the candidate and kills the opener; Jira renders the line literally and jiro keeps it as text.
-- input.jira --
*1*2*
-- rendered.html --
<p>*1*2*</p>
-- want.md --
\*1\*2\*
-- warnings.json --
[]
